    "description": "The Telecom eSIM Provisioning API facilitates the seamless onboarding of eSIMs for telecommunications. This endpoint allows service providers to provision eSIM profiles, enabling users to activate mobile services without the need for physical SIM cards. Typically utilized by telecom companies and application developers, this API streamlines the provisioning process, improves customer experience, and supports the growing demand for digital connectivity solutions. Ensure efficient management of eSIM activations and provide enhanced services to end-users through a unified interface.",
